    "lesson": "BPF v4 is a compiler preset, not a kernel promise; LLVM 18 original bundle is signed loads/moves, byte swap, signed div/rem, long jumps, immediate stores; acqrel in 6.15, indirect jumps in 6.19 (493d9e0d6083); LLVM 23 v4 enables both newer groups."
