  "notes": [
    "No BPF compiler runs during tests; these bytes are the frozen emission record.",
    "acq.ll hangs llc 21.1.8 below -mcpu=v4 (selection loop, killed by timeout 2026-10-23); recorded, not re-probed per run.",
    "LLVM 21 emits jump32, signed jumps and byte-swap even at -mcpu=generic: preset names cannot admit baseline-only objects. Profiles pin exact effective subsets.",
    "llvm-objdump confirms ST-IMM (0x7a) and JMP32-JA/gotol (0x06) encodings; JMP-JA|X (0x0d) is <unknown> to LLVM 21 and stays a design-frozen rule until the TC07 live gate.",
    "SDIV/SMOD use DIV/MOD opcodes with off=1; MOVSX uses MOV with off=source-width; load-acquire uses STX/BPF_ATOMIC with imm=0x100 (BPF_LOAD_ACQ): all confirmed in emitted bytes."
